@startuml SplitSmartExpenseApproval
actor Submitter
actor Reviewer
participant "Expense Use Case" as UseCase
participant "Membership / Allocation Domain" as Domain
database "Transactional Store" as Store
participant "Notification Port" as Notify
Submitter -> UseCase : submit expense
UseCase -> Domain : validate member, payer,\nparticipants, date and amount
Domain --> UseCase : validated exact allocations
UseCase -> Store : save PENDING expense,\npolicy snapshot, review levels,\nnotification intents
Store --> UseCase : committed
UseCase -> Notify : deliver eligible notifications
note over Store
  No balance posting while pending.
  Delivery can retry; reads recheck authorization.
end note
Reviewer -> UseCase : decide(level, outcome)
UseCase -> Store : verify pending state,\nreviewer eligibility and uniqueness
Store --> UseCase : accepted decision
alt Rejection at required level
  UseCase -> Store : atomically set REJECTED
  note right of Store : No financial posting.
else All required levels approve
  UseCase -> Store : atomically set APPROVED\nand insert unique postings
  note right of Store : One source posting key; commit together.
else More approvals remain
  UseCase -> Store : persist decision only
end
Store --> UseCase : committed or conflict
UseCase --> Reviewer : explicit result
@enduml
